# The build context is the repo root. Nothing in this image needs source outside
# apps/website, so this is aggressive on purpose: matisa-old alone is 1.7GB and
# would otherwise be uploaded to the daemon on every build.
*

!apps/website/site
!apps/website/nginx.conf

# Stale local build artifacts that live under site/. They are gitignored, so a
# Dokploy build from a fresh clone never sees them — but a local `docker build`
# would, and a 150MB zip in the image is not a thing to find out about later.
apps/website/site/updates
